# === LIGHTHOUSE KEEPER ===
# Picked by keeper.gd on the first visit.

~ keeper_intro
Keeper: Another storm tonight. [#reaction=keeper_tired_1]
Sailor: Is the lamp still working? [#reaction=sailor_worried_1, mood=anxious]
Keeper: Mostly. Ask me again at midnight. [#reaction=keeper_tired_2, mood=dry]
do emit_quest_npc_talked("keeper")
=> END

## Shown once the oil is found.
~ keeper_oil
# ✏ production (wording pending)
Keeper: You found it! [#reaction=keeper_happy_1]
- Hand over the oil [#thought]
	Keeper: Bless you. [#reaction=keeper_happy_2]
	do set_flag("oil_delivered")
- Keep it for now [if not Globals.has_flag("promised")]
    Keeper: Suit yourself.
	Keeper: The lamp won't wait. [#reaction=keeper_tired_1, shake]
- Ask about the ship => keeper_ship
=> END

~ keeper_ship
Keeper: [[Ah|Well|Hm]], the ship. {{ Globals.ship_name }} went down in '79.
=> END!
